description:
Design a 3-stage shift register that captures a single bit input (D) on the rising edge of the clock (Clk). The output Qa directly holds the value of D, Qb holds the value of Qa from the previous clock cycle, and Qc stores the value of Qb from its previous cycle, effectively propagating the input D through three successive registers.
module top_module(
    input D, Clk,
    output reg Qa, Qb, Qc
    );

code:
module top_module(
    input D, Clk,
    output reg Qa, Qb, Qc
    );always @(posedge Clk) begin
        Qa <= D;
        Qb <= Qa;
        Qc <= Qb;
    end

endmodule

